          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hiyakutiya kuwaha nakudyaloŋana, nakuhameka Nzambi namuchima wawuwahi. Hiyakuyimona kuwaha kudi antu ejima. Mwanta hakubombelaku hefuku hefuku awa adiŋi nakuhanda.",
          "type": "text",
